# RoboShadow Refresh Token. Generate at your RoboShadow portal -> Reports ->
# API Token, which shows an Organisation ID, a short-lived Bearer Token, and
# this Refresh Token. This connector stores the Refresh Token (it does not
# expire on the ~1hr cadence the Bearer Token does) and exchanges it for a
# fresh Bearer Token internally before each API call via POST
# /identity/bearertoken.
ROBOSHADOW_REFRESH_TOKEN=
